# 6️⃣ Deletion from Beginning

## 📖 Steps

Move Head to second node.

↓

Delete first node.

---

### Visualization

Before

```
10 → 20 → 30
```

After

```
20 → 30
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
void deleteBeginning(Node* &head)
{
    if(head == NULL)
        return;

    Node* temp = head;

    head = head->next;

    delete temp;
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(1)
```

