# 9️⃣ Length of Linked List

## 📖 Definition

Count the total number of nodes.

---

### Example

```
10 → 20 → 30 → 40
```

Length

```
4
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
int length(Node* head)
{
    int count = 0;

    while(head != NULL)
    {
        count++;

        head = head->next;
    }

    return count;
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

